LT-OPD

This distribution includes modified training components from verl and SDPO,
and CDPruner and HoliTom-inspired DPC implementations for Qwen3.5. Original copyright notices are
retained in the source files.

verl: https://github.com/volcengine/verl (Apache-2.0)
SDPO: https://github.com/lasgroup/SDPO (Apache-2.0)
CDPruner: https://github.com/Theia-4869/CDPruner (Apache-2.0)
HoliTom: https://github.com/cokeshao/HoliTom (Apache-2.0)
Transformers: https://github.com/huggingface/transformers (Apache-2.0)

Benchmark scorers are obtained from their original repositories at the
revisions recorded in src/evaluation/sources.json. Their original licenses
and attribution apply.

Training data is distributed separately. Its component licenses and attribution
are listed in the dataset repository; this code license does not relicense
third-party datasets or images.
